			"notes": "**EarlyLoadingScreen 0.1.1 for Minecraft 1.19.2, 1.19.4, 1.20.1 is released**\n\nThis is mostly a bug fix release.\n\nChangelog:\n- fix: hard crash on MacOS\n- fix: window not responding on Windows (`reuse_early_window` no longer exists on Windows)\n- fix: workaround mixin issue for ImmediatelyFast (#1 on 1.19.4+)\n- fix: do not defer loading the missing model (#3)\n- change: use a less invasive way to estimate model loading progress (#4 on 1.19.2)\n- feat: monitor model dependency resolution\n- feat: support CaffeineMC mixin-config style mixin disablement in config (#2)\n- change: modid to earlyloadingscreen\n\nFull changelog (1.20.1 branch): https://github.com/ishland/EarlyLoadingScreen/compare/0.1.0...0.1.1"
